    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/Mysttic/simple-rest/releases/tag/v@VERSION@</releaseNotes>
    <tags>rest http api client tcp hl7 mllp postman-alternative portable</tags>
    <summary>REST and TCP client in one file, with its UI in the browser</summary>
    <description>
simple-rest is a Postman-like REST client that is a single program. It serves its interface on http://127.0.0.1:8787/ and sends the requests itself, so CORS never gets in the way.

- Collections, history and environments with `{{variables}}`, import from Postman, copy as cURL.
- Schedules that send a saved request every few minutes and keep a variable such as a token fresh.
- A TCP console for devices on the network: text or hex messages, framing (LF, CR LF, MLLP, STX/ETX), reply times.

The package keeps the data in `%APPDATA%\simple-rest`. Update it with `choco upgrade simple-rest`.
    </description>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
